# Diagnostic: frame pacing with 90 cues on screen. Capture mtimes give the
# wall time of 30 presented frames, paused and then playing. Run with
# CAMBIUM_HOST_PERF_TRACE=1 for the host's per-frame breakdown in stderr.log.
settle 30
act pane:notes
settle 10
pointer-click 520 221
settle 120
assert snap transcript-cues >= 80
capture t0
settle 30
capture t1-paused-30
act seek:0
act play
settle 30
capture t2-playing-30
assert event transport PLAYING
act pause
settle 30
capture t3-paused-again-30
log timing complete
